   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "Guildrun",
   "y": -560,
   "fontSize": 120
  },
  {
   "x": 0,
   "bgColor": "#0b1a3a",
   "bgOpacity": 0.0,
   "bgPadding": 0,
   "outline": 10,
   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "11 HOURS. MEDIAN.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 74
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody quit this Steam\ndemo in under ten minutes.\nNot one reviewer.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.591,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The median player had\neleven hours in before\nthey wrote anything.",
   "start": 4.841,
   "duration": 3.598,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "So here's what it is.\nGuildrun is a PvE\nautobattler roguelike. You\ndraft a team of heroes,\nyou bend them out of the\nclass they started in, and\nthen you watch the fight\nresolve itself without\ntouching anything.",
   "start": 15.689,
   "duration": 12.01,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty five heroes, three\nhundred relics and a\nhundred items in the demo\nalone. No timer, no queue,\nno PvP. You think as long\nas you want.",
   "start": 27.949,
   "duration": 9.136,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. It's Unity,\nand IL2CPP usually hides\nwhat a team used.",
   "start": 37.335,
   "duration": 6.054,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Except twenty four\nassembly names leak out in\na data file. Here's what\nthey installed.",
   "start": 43.639,
   "duration": 4.904,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "They didn't bounce. They\nhit the ceiling. Full\nteardown on the channel.",
   "start": 62.001,
   "duration": 4.539,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
